flowchart TB
  Disc[MODEM_DISCOVERY] --> DSC[QMI-DSC preflight]
  DSC --> DMS[QMI-DMS identity mode]
  DMS --> UIM[QMI-UIM card states]
  UIM --> Gate{SIM ready and APN set?}
  Gate -->|no| SM_err[QMI-SM Error backoff hotplug]
  Gate -->|yes| NAS[QMI-NAS register RF]
  NAS --> WDS[QMI-WDS session]
  WDS --> NET[QMI-NET iface ping]
  NET --> SM_ok[QMI-SM happy path restart]
  SM_err --> Gaps[COMPLIANCE_GAPS not FAIL]
  SM_ok --> Gaps

  UIM -.->|fixture| F1[no_SIM runnable today]
  UIM -.->|fixture| F2[plain_SIM planned]
  UIM -.->|SKIP| F3[PIN_SIM unavailable]
  NAS -.->|fixture| F4[RF_attenuate]
  WDS -.->|fixture| F5[wrong_APN]
  WDS -.->|placeholder| F6[APN_TBD]
